# Gaze Holdings — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit real tokens.

# ── Instagram feed (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Long-lived Instagram Graph API access token (Instagram Login flow).
# With no token set, the homepage gallery shows curated fallback tiles.
# How to obtain:
#   1. Create a Meta app at https://developers.facebook.com
#   2. Connect an Instagram Business/Creator account
#   3. Generate a long-lived token (refreshes ~every 60 days)
INSTAGRAM_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# ── Price sheet publishing (/furnishings/price-list) ─────────────────────────
# Set both on the host for "Publish to the site" to work. Without them the page still
# works, and the client downloads her prices as a file instead.
# PRICE_SHEET_PASSWORD: the password the client types to publish. Make it long.
# GITHUB_TOKEN: a fine-grained token limited to this repository, with Contents: read and write.
PRICE_SHEET_PASSWORD=
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# ── Contact form delivery (later session) ────────────────────────────────────
# RESEND_API_KEY=
